      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيِّرٌ</span></b>  <i>A grave.</i> (AA, O, K. [Perhaps so called
as being the ulterior abode.]) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيِّرُ فُلَانٍ</span> <i>This is the grave of such a one.</i> (O.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <i>A company</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَاعَة</span>). (O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صور</span>.

